{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Awaking Beauty&quot;</strong> is a two-character roguelite action game that blends sci-fi and fantasy. You\u2019ll play as selected high school girls piloting dream-diving mechas to rescue those trapped in the dream world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u203b Playable in both single-player and co-op modes.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1769643209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras_big/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1769643209 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/1e4de46789ddd21efe192810c79015c0.poster.avif?t=1769643209\" width=592 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/1e4de46789ddd21efe192810c79015c0.webm?t=1769643209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/1e4de46789ddd21efe192810c79015c0.mp4?t=1769643209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 Diverse Combat Builds \u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Prefer close-range destruction or long-range suppression? The choice is yours!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick 2 out of 4 characters, then shape a one-of-a-kind playstyle with roguelite chips that drop randomly during each run. The same weapon can spark completely different results depending on who wields it!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Co-op: freely adjust your strongest partner combo back in the lab.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solo: your AI teammate has your back, and you can swap your controlled character anytime to pull off stylish combos!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keywords: chip builds, roguelite, beat \u2019em up</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1769643209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras_big/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1769643209 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/f0503f277cb06a8ef0fd5f335cdb6ddb.poster.avif?t=1769643209\" width=650 height=366 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/f0503f277cb06a8ef0fd5f335cdb6ddb.webm?t=1769643209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/f0503f277cb06a8ef0fd5f335cdb6ddb.mp4?t=1769643209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25c6 Dream-Turbo x Fusion Transformation \u25c6</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dream-Turbo converts nightmare energy into explosive power, moving faster and hitting harder!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When things get desperate, you have multiple tactical options:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Dream Assembly: mount your partner onto you and become a mobile turret for maximum covering fire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fusion Transformation: resonate in sync and merge into an ultimate mecha form, then wipe out nightmares with unstoppable force!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keywords: co-op, dual characters, mecha fusion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1769643209\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras_big/11bad7e8936922e0eb4aede2324c40bd.avif?t=1769643209 width=800 height=53 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/579b9a678253214aacd91af6e95bf38d.poster.avif?t=1769643209\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/579b9a678253214aacd91af6e95bf38d.webm?t=1769643209\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3253950/extras/579b9a678253214aacd91af6e95bf38d.mp4?t=1769643209\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u25c6 A Story Where Dreams and Reality Intertwine \u25c6</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;I... can I become friends with everyone?&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dreams are reflections of real memories.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These mecha-piloting girls dive into the depths of the subconscious, facing not only vicious nightmares, but also the twisted fantasies and emptiness hidden in people\u2019s hearts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this rescue mission, you will gradually uncover the truth behind the collapse of the dream world...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keywords: narrative, girls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared